flowchart TD
    subgraph S1 [1. Specify: no credits spent]
        direction LR
        A[Business requirements] --> B[Owner writes task spec]
        B --> C{Reviewer:<br/>definition of ready?}
        C -- No --> B
    end
    subgraph S2 [2. Implement and validate]
        direction LR
        D[Delegate implements with Copilot<br/>code + tests] --> F[Owner validates]
        F --> G{Issue?}
        G -- Yes --> H[Owner updates spec]
        H --> D
    end
    subgraph S3 [3. Ship]
        direction LR
        I[Owner opens PR] --> K[Same CI/CD and quality gates] --> L[Merge]
    end
    S1 -- "Yes: ready" --> S2
    S2 -- "No issue" --> S3
